 g paddle around the harbor to more than 20 waterfront spots serving barbec
 ue\, craft beer and cocktails while John Hart and Tyler Mac play live blue
 s. Guests vote for the best food and drinks of the night.\n\nPrice: No pub
 lished price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-harborwalk
 -blues-brews-bbq-1109.html
