SUMMARY:Guys and Dolls at Stage Crafters
LOCATION:Stage Crafters Theatre\, 109 Miracle Strip Pkwy SW\, Fort Walton B
 each\, FL 32548
DESCRIPTION:Fri 11/6 to Sun 11/15 · Fri and Sat 7:30 PM\, Sun 2:00 PM\n\nS
 tage Crafters stages the Damon Runyon musical comedy Guys and Dolls over t
 wo weekends in November. Gambler Nathan Detroit hunts for cash to run the 
 biggest craps game in New York while his fiancee Adelaide waits out a four
 teen-year engagement. The company bills itself as Florida's oldest all-vol
 unteer community theatre\, now in its 54th year.\n\nPrice: from $32\n\nDet
 ails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-guys-and-dolls-stagecrafters-
 1106.html
