SUMMARY:Qigong classes at Historic Blakeley
LOCATION:Historic Blakeley State Park\, 34745 State Hwy 225\, Spanish Fort\
 , AL 36527
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 11/7 · 9:00 AM to 10:00 AM · Saturday 11/21 · 9:00 
 AM to 10:00 AM\n\nHistoric Blakeley State Park offers guided Qigong\, a sl
 ow\, low-impact practice that combines movement\, deep breathing and visua
 lization and is described as an ancestor of Tai Chi. Classes run from 9:00
  AM to 10:00 AM on Saturday 11/7 and Saturday 11/21\, with an optional gro
 up hike afterward. They take place rain or shine unless there is lightning
  or severe weather.\n\nPrice: from $10\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventure
 s.com/events/ev-blakeley-qigong-classes-1107.html
