 ecording the firsthand accounts of Vietnam veterans at the Azalea Trace re
 tirement community in Pensacola. The resulting documentary premieres in th
 e Mainstage Theatre after a public reception. The film runs about 1 hour 4
 0 minutes and shows each veteran's own account of service rather than a si
 ngle narrative of the war.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastalevent
 ures.com/events/ev-uwf-their-vietnam-1110.html
